# packwiz hashes raw file bytes, so line endings must be stable across checkouts.
# Pin LF for everything packwiz tracks (Windows autocrlf otherwise flips files
# on pull and produces phantom hash churn in index.toml, as happened 2026-09-13
# with kubejs/server_scripts/reconstructed_wands.js and 2026-09-16 with the
# whole index after a Windows refresh wrote CRLF hashes).
# Binary paths (jars, zips, search indexes) stay untouched below.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
config/ars_nouveau/search_index/** binary
kubejs/** text eol=lf
